  "@type": "DefinedTerm",
  "alternateName": "Macrophyte communities species composition, relative abundance or depth distribution with no adverse effect by nutrient enrichment",
  "description": "The species composition and relative\nabundance or depth distribution of\nmacrophyte communities achieve values\nthat indicate there is no adverse effect due\nto nutrient enrichment including via a decrease in water transparency, as follows:\n(a) in coastal waters, the values set in accordance with Directive 2000/60/EC;\n(b) should this criterion be relevant for\nwaters beyond coastal waters, values\nconsistent with those for coastal\nwaters under Directive 2000/60/EC.\nMember States shall establish those\nvalues through regional or subregional\ncooperation.",
  "disambiguatingDescription": "This term was created by MBO WP1 task 1.3 with external domain experts during the MARCO-BOLO Project to express that this object is of relevance to the named criterion of the MFSD",
